cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Dripito — Open-Source IV Drip Flow Monitor (Rev-B)"
abstract: >-
  A single-AA-cell intravenous-infusion flow-rate monitor for pediatric care
  in resource-constrained clinical settings. Custom STM32G0 PCB, optical
  dual-beam drop detection, monochrome graphic LCD, piezo alarm, and
  ASA-printed enclosure. Designed and built as an MSc semester project at
  ETH Global Health Engineering, 2026.
license: CERN-OHL-2.0
